#: opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The Sharp backend is based on the Canon backend written by Helmut Koeberle."
msgstr ""
"Controlorul Sharp este bazat pe controlorul Canon scris de Helmut Koeberle."

#. type: Plain text
